                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a917698-7c0a-3926-abf0-04c3f1c828ec",
                        "entry_id": "54b8a5ec-d6bf-32e4-9e03-7c191aad45f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "grandfather; grandfather's"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80b3f351-aff0-40b3-9817-a9b12414e476",
                                "sense_id": "0a917698-7c0a-3926-abf0-04c3f1c828ec",
                                "text": "День был све́тлый; в два окна́, сквозь ледяны́е стё́кла, смотре́ли косы́е лучи́ зи́мнего со́лнца; на столе́, у́бранном к обе́ду, ту́скло блесте́ла оловя́нная посу́да, графи́н с ры́жим ква́сом и друго́й с тё́мно-зелё́ной де́довой во́дкой, насто́янной на бу́квице и зверобо́е.",
                                "translation": "It was a bright day; the slanting rays of the winter sun peered through the icy windows. On the table, laid for supper, dimly shone pewter cups, a decanter of golden kvass, and another of Grandfather’s dark green vodka, distilled from cowslip and St John’s wort.",
                                "english": "It was a bright day; the slanting rays of the winter sun peered through the icy windows. On the table, laid for supper, dimly shone pewter cups, a decanter of golden kvass, and another of Grandfather’s dark green vodka, distilled from cowslip and St John’s wort."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
